data_LiH_molecular
# LiH diatomic molecule in a P1 cubic box.
# Bond length 1.5949 Å (experimental r_e for LiH ground state).
# Box edge 12.0 Å for PBC image isolation.
# Used as the L1 quantum slot active-space VQE fixture; the 5e-3 Ha gate is
# computed against PySCF active-space CASCI/CASSCF reference.
# Source: K. P. Huber and G. Herzberg, "Molecular Spectra and Molecular
# Structure: IV. Constants of Diatomic Molecules", 1979 (LiH bond constants).
_cell_length_a 12.0
_cell_length_b 12.0
_cell_length_c 12.0
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 90.0
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
